  <p>
    <b>About LBank</b>
  </p>
  
  <p>
    <span style="font-weight: 400;">LBank is an ever-growing <a class="wpil_keyword_link" href="https://technologymanias.com/category/news" title="crypto">crypto</a> trading platform which offers safe trading for the users worldwide. The team aspires to build the professional integration services for crypto-assets being a convenient trading platform. It has become popular with over 6.4 million users around the world.</span>
  </p>
  
